meta {
  name: 04_ConsentEvents
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Scenario: An enterprise follows status changes on its consent requests

    When the enterprise reads its consent events
    And follows the next link to the following page
    And filters the events by event type
    And filters the events to a time window with no events
    When the event type is unknown, the request fails with a validation error
    When the time window is inverted, the request fails with a validation error
    When the continuation token is malformed, the request fails with a validation error
    When no token is sent, the request is unauthorized

  Read only. The enterprise's events come from earlier runs of the consent scenarios;
  events younger than five minutes are held back by the API, so this scenario asserts the
  shape, order and filtering of whatever older events exist and never an exact count.
}
